# Testing conventions

- Test service business logic independently of HTTP handlers.
- Test controllers for HTTP behavior where appropriate.
- Test repository queries and mappings with integration tests.
- Add regression tests for bug fixes.
- Keep tests deterministic and avoid real external services.
- Never remove tests simply to make a change pass.
- Run the relevant tests and report the actual outcome.
